# r1106cbo single boot: chain + ADD="alexsmobs-*.jar,citadel-*.jar,Quark-*.jar,AutoRegLib-*.jar", group A (SQ-CBO-51)
## SQ-CBO-51 | chain + alexsmobs-*.jar,citadel-*.jar,Quark-*.jar,AutoRegLib-*.jar
bootexpect \[creativebrewing\] members: \[vinery, brewinandchewin\]$
bootreject Missing or unsupported mandatory|Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException|creativebrewing.*(NoClassDefFoundError|ClassNotFoundException)|Encountered an unexpected exception
shell ! grep -nE "ReferenceError|TypeError|EvaluatorException|is not defined" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log
> cbo all
waitlog \[cbo\] done 30
# the 4 unguarded echo tool rows (tool_effects.js 134-137, found r1106cbo boot 1) are tolerated; any other leak fails
expect effects leaks [04]$
reject \[cbo\] leak (?!tool onHit item creativeengineering:echo_(pickaxe|axe|shovel|hoe)$)
expect mods loaded 2 of 24: alexsmobs, quark$
> forceload add 0 0
sleep 1
> kill @e[tag=cbo]
> summon minecraft:iron_golem 0 -60 5 {Tags:["cbo"],NoAI:1b}
sleep 1
> effect give @e[tag=cbo] quark:resilience 60 0
sleep 1
> data get entity @e[tag=cbo,limit=1] ActiveEffects
sleep 2
> kill @e[tag=cbo]
expect "forge:id": "alexsmobs:knockback_resistance"
reject "forge:id": "quark:resilience"
shell grep -h "\[CE potions\]\|\[food values\].*effect swaps\|\[alcohol\] food values\|tipped arrow tipping done\|potion bottling done\|jeed_providers.js:\|\[fluid_jei\]\|dragon-breath\|Lingerification" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log logs/latest.log | sed -E 's/^\[[^]]*\] \[[^]]*\]: //' | sort | uniq -c
look mix count above SQ-CBO-20's
